---
/**
 * The pause overlay the real-time Games share: Hollanda'da sürüş (surus) and
 * Kayak macerası (kayak). Drop it inside the playfield's positioned box; it
 * covers that box when shown.
 *
 * THE RULE IT ANNOUNCES is `src/lib/bday26/pause-dom.ts`'s, one helper both
 * pages call (`createPause`): P pauses and P resumes; a lost window focus or
 * a hidden tab pauses too and stays paused when she comes back, until she
 * presses P. While it shows, the clock, the physics and the timers stand
 * still. The helper toggles `hidden` on the element carrying
 * `data-pause-overlay`; nothing here has a script.
 */
---

<div class="pause-overlay" data-pause-overlay role="status" hidden>
  <p class="big">Duraklatıldı</p>
  <p class="how">Devam etmek için <kbd>P</kbd>'ye bas</p>
</div>

<style>
  .pause-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 5;
    display: grid;
    place-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    text-align: center;
    background: rgb(58 45 42 / 0.62);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }
  .pause-overlay[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
  .pause-overlay p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .big {
    font-family: var(--bd-display);
    font-size: 96px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35);
  }
  .how {
    padding: 12px 26px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bd-paper);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--bd-ink);
  }
  kbd {
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 1px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bd-accent-soft);
    color: var(--bd-accent-deep);
  }
</style>
